      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "The machine is busy, but I have filter coffee ready now in a medium cup. I can give you that and a dollar back, or a full refund."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Can I have the medium with milk and no sugar?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes, of course. Would that work for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Yes, I'll take that, please. I still want a coffee before I go."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Medium coffee with milk, no sugar, and one dollar back. Sorry about that."
    }
